# Path to your idea64.exe
# - First non-empty, non-comment line is used as the path.
# - Comment lines start with #.
# - Rename this file to .idea-path.txt (drop the .sample suffix) to enable.
# Examples:
# C:\Program Files\JetBrains\IntelliJ IDEA 2024.3\bin\idea64.exe
# D:\JetBrains\IntelliJ IDEA 2025.1\bin\idea64.exe
